cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use STARS Observatory in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "STARS Observatory"
abstract: "STARS Observatory is a demonstrative evidence instrument. Each day it takes the public catalogue of objects in Earth orbit and shows the legal layer that governs them: which State the catalogue attributes each object to, whether and when a matching entry appears in the United Nations Register of Objects Launched into Outer Space, and how documented incidents unfolded in time."
type: software
authors:
